{"id":"1553140660277891073","date":"2022-07-29","url":"https://x.com/logangraham/status/1553140660277891073","author":"logangraham","text":"When you find a rare, high-leverage, high-hinge moment, seize it.\n\nSharing your wild, brilliant, weird ideas with @ARIA_research is one of those moments.\n\nSeniority, weirdness, and outlandishness don't matter.","quoted":{"url":"https://x.com/ARIA_research/status/1553003929532829702","text":"Scientists/technologists/researchers: Where and how can ARIA have the biggest impact?\n\nTell us and help shape our vision by signing up at https://t.co/ja0uvFn7Ls to host a roundtable attended by our CEO @ilangur."},"live_status":200,"archived_at":"20220729225806","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220729225806/https://twitter.com/logangraham/status/1553140660277891073","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
