{"id":"1549446166294630401","date":"2022-07-19","url":"https://x.com/logangraham/status/1549446166294630401","author":"logangraham","text":"James is an absolute hero. And we were blessed with the best at @beisgovuk.","reply_to":"logangraham","quoted":{"url":"https://x.com/Dominic2306/status/1549292835412869121","text":"4/ Also brilliant work by a young neuroscientist, James Phillips, who came to No10 spring 2020. Apart from saving many lives on covid, e.g making us realise the possibilities of rapid testing, he shepherded #ARIA thro the treacherous shoals of Whitehall. + Jo S @ BEIS ❤️ ❤️ ❤️"},"live_status":200,"archived_at":"20220719172942","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220719172942/https://twitter.com/logangraham/status/1549446166294630401","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
{"id":"1549446164289708032","date":"2022-07-19","url":"https://x.com/logangraham/status/1549446164289708032","author":"logangraham","text":"Links here. Go go go.","reply_to":"logangraham","quoted":{"url":"https://x.com/matthewclifford/status/1549302146876772352","text":"8/ ARIA can have truly enormous impact - and we’ll need lots of help. We’re recruiting right now for NEDs and a CEO. Please apply and/or share far and wide:\n\nhttps://t.co/sKh9JG4Fd6\n\nhttps://t.co/KkdZjmrfuq"},"live_status":200,"archived_at":"20220719172931","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220719172931/https://twitter.com/logangraham/status/1549446164289708032","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
{"id":"1549446161882222593","date":"2022-07-19","url":"https://x.com/logangraham/status/1549446161882222593","author":"logangraham","text":"ARIA is/will be one of the most transformative advancements in UK science. @ilangur and @matthewclifford are world-class.\n\nOne of my proudest achievements/contributions in No10.\n\nIt now needs incredible programme managers and NEDs. Apply. https://t.co/6NP243CKCR","quoted":{"url":"https://x.com/ilangur/status/1549287199631216640","text":"Today, @activatefellows &amp; UK government announced my appointment as founding CEO of the Advanced Research and Invention Agency (ARIA). With an £800M initial funding commitment, ARIA will support ground-breaking R&amp;D to transform society for the better. /1\n\nhttps://t.co/m3wvxFuyBd"},"live_status":200,"archived_at":"20220719172953","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220719172953/https://twitter.com/logangraham/status/1549446161882222593","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
